格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek Web 对话导入","id":"gh:1335900558","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"deepseek-web-import","slug":"wpc0323/deepseek-web-import","topics":["dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"# DeepSeek Web Chat Import (DeepSeek Harness plugin)"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"**English** | 中文"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Import your chat.deepseek.com **conversation history as real DeepSeek Harness (DSH) sessions**: each"},{"id":"p3s2","text":" import appears in the sidebar workspace list, **opens with its full history, and can be continued w"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"in the sidebar workspace list, **opens with its full history, and can be continued with any model**."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"> This is an **installable DSH plugin bundle** (`dsh.bundle` manifest: a host half plus a web client"},{"id":"p4s2","text":" half), installed with `dsh plugin add`. See Install below."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Screenshots"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## ✨ Features"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"- A **\"DeepSeek Chat Import\"** page inside the settings panel\n- Paste a `userToken` and fetch the **"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"conversation directory** in one click (titles + dates only; transcripts are fetched on import)\n- Pic"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"k a **target workspace** per conversation and **import it as a DSH session** in one click\n- Imported"},{"id":"p7s4","text":" sessions:\n- keep the original DeepSeek title\n- can be **continued with a model of your choice** (th"},{"id":"p7s5","text":"ey take DSH's normal resume path, so they never hit `cannot prepare session while it is live`)\n- are"},{"id":"p7s6","text":" persisted under `~/.dsh/sessions/<workspace>/` and survive a DSH restart\n- Extracts the `value` fie"},{"id":"p7s7","text":"ld from a `userToken` automatically (accepts the `{\"value\":\"...\",\"__version\":\"0\"}` form)\n- A built-i"},{"id":"p7s8","text":"n **Diagnostics** section for requesting raw responses when the upstream API changes\n- **Localized U"},{"id":"p7s9","text":"I** (English/Chinese) that follows the DSH/browser language and falls back to English"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## ⚠️ Important"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"> **Refresh the page (F5) after importing a conversation** so the sidebar shows the new session imme"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"diately.\n>\n> Without a refresh the new session may only appear after the next session-list refresh o"},{"id":"p9s3","text":" Without a refresh the new session may only appear after the next session-list refresh or reconnect."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"**Prerequisite:** a `node` executable on PATH (Node.js). The plugin performs its request in a `node`"},{"id":"p11s2","text":" child process (DSH's `web.fetch` cannot carry custom headers); without Node.js the page says it can"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"not start Node.js, and why, instead of failing to load the directory for no visible reason."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"The plugin declares `dsh.bundle` (see `package.json`), so it installs with `dsh plugin add`:"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Compatibility (DSH Session format v0–v4)"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Every DSH release writes one session format (v0…v4). The plugin adapts to the running build. Measure"},{"id":"p16s2","text":" release writes one session format (v0…v4). The plugin adapts to the running build. Measured matrix:"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"| DSH version | Session format | Status |"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"| 0.1.0-rc.7 – 0.1.2-rc.1 | v0 | ✅ verified against the real backend |\n| (unreleased) | v1 | ✅ model"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"ed as v0 + runtime dialect evidence |\n| 0.1.3-alpha.2 | v2 | ✅ verified against the real backend |\n|"},{"id":"p18s3","text":" 0.1.5-alpha.1 – 0.1.6-alpha.2 | v3 | ✅ verified against the real backend |\n| 0.1.7-alpha.1+ (includ"},{"id":"p18s4","text":"ing desktop 0.2.0-rc.2) | v4 | ✅ verified against the real backend |"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"How each row was verified, and where the evidence comes from, is in docs/COMPATIBILITY.md (Chinese)."},{"id":"p19s2","text":" `npm test` runs the unit tests; `sh test/matrix.sh` runs the full matrix."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## How it works (briefly)"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"- **Architecture**: `lib/index.js` (host half) registers same-origin JSON routes (`/__deepseek-web-i"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"mport/*`) on DSH's `webServer`; `lib/client.js` (web client half) calls them with `fetch` from the s"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"ettings page. No dynamic-plugin machinery is involved, so the plugin stays installed across restarts"},{"id":"p21s4","text":".\n- **Endpoints** (unofficial DeepSeek web internals, confirmed by reverse-engineering their own JS "},{"id":"p21s5","text":"bundle):\n- conversation directory: `GET /api/v0/chat_session/fetch_page?count=100`\n- conversation hi"},{"id":"p21s6","text":"story: `GET /api/v0/chat/history_messages?chat_session_id=<uuid>`\n- **Import as session**: history m"},{"id":"p21s7","text":"essages are translated into valid DSH session events (`turn/start → user/message → step/start → assi"},{"id":"p21s8","text":"stant/message → step/end → turn/end`, surface events carrying `surfaceOp: \"append\"`, plus `session/t"},{"id":"p21s9","text":"itle` and `session/end-seed`), **written to persistence only** (v0/v1 through `create(meta)` + `appe"},{"id":"p21s10","text":"nd(id, events)`, v2+ through the write handle returned by `create(header)`), and then attached to th"},{"id":"p21s11","text":"e chosen workspace with `workspace.attachSession` — the session **never enters the live store**, whi"},{"id":"p21s12","text":"ch is what makes it openable and continuable. A history that ends with an unanswered user question k"},{"id":"p21s13","text":"eeps its unclosed turn; DSH closes it with `interrupted` when the session is opened.\n- **Body and re"},{"id":"p21s14","text":"asoning**: DeepSeek keeps the text in `fragments` (`REQUEST`/`RESPONSE`/`THINK`). A user question co"},{"id":"p21s15","text":"mes from `REQUEST`; an answer uses `RESPONSE` as the text and `THINK` as a `reasoning` block. Event "},{"id":"p21s16","text":"times come from the message's `inserted_at`.\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Known limitations"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"- It depends on DeepSeek's **unofficial internal API**, which can break when the web app is redesign"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"ed (use Diagnostics to see the raw response when it does).\n- Password sign-in is blocked by DeepSeek"},{"id":"p23s3","text":"'s **bot protection (AWS WAF)**, so the `userToken` route is the only one.\n- The directory fetches a"},{"id":"p23s4","text":"t most **100 conversations**: the measured `fetch_page` response carries only `chat_sessions` + `has"},{"id":"p23s5","text":"_more`, with no usable cursor field (`cursor`/`lte_cursor` have no effect), so beyond 100 you get th"},{"id":"p23s6","text":"e latest 100.\n- `userToken` expires after some hours to days; copy and save a fresh one when it does"},{"id":"p23s7","text":".\n- The plugin installs as a bundle through `dsh plugin add` and stays installed across DSH restarts"},{"id":"p23s8","text":".\n- Web-search steps (`TOOL_SEARCH`/`TOOL_OPEN` fragments) and message status (an `INCOMPLETE` answe"},{"id":"p23s9","text":"r cut off while generating) are not preserved: web search has no DSH event to map onto, so only the "},{"id":"p23s10","text":"text and reasoning are imported; an interrupted answer keeps whatever text/reasoning it had.\n- Impor"},{"id":"p23s11","text":"ting the same DeepSeek conversation twice creates **two** DSH sessions (the plugin keeps no \"DeepSee"},{"id":"p23s12","text":"k conversation id → DSH session id\" mapping) and DSH's persistence offers no delete, so archive the "},{"id":"p23s13","text":" DSH session id\" mapping) and DSH's persistence offers no delete, so archive the duplicate yourself."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"- The response cap for one import is about **2M characters** (a conversation over it returns `too_la"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"rge` rather than being silently truncated).\n- An attachment-only message imports as one explicit not"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"e; non-conversation roles (`SYSTEM`/`TOOL`, …) are ignored.\n- An import follows the single main line"},{"id":"p24s4","text":" returned by `history_messages` (it does not resolve `parent_id` branches): if DeepSeek returns sibl"},{"id":"p24s5","text":"ing branches for an edit/regenerate, they are imported as two consecutive turns."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Security"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"- Never leak your account password or `userToken` in a conversation, issue, or repository.\n- If you "},{"id":"p26s2","text":"have pasted your password into a chat, change your DeepSeek password now."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}

