urself."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"- The response cap for one import is about **2M characters** (a conversation over it returns `too_la"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"rge` rather than being silently truncated).\n- An attachment-only message imports as one explicit not"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"e; non-conversation roles (`SYSTEM`/`TOOL`, …) are ignored.\n- An import follows the single main line"},{"id":"p24s4","text":" returned by `history_messages` (it does not resolve `parent_id` branches): if DeepSeek returns sibl"},{"id":"p24s5","text":"ing branches for an edit/regenerate, they are imported as two consecutive turns."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Security"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"- Never leak your account password or `userToken` in a conversation, issue, or repository.\n- If you "},{"id":"p26s2","text":"have pasted your password into a chat, change your DeepSeek password now."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"},{"content":"上次校验失败；重新生成完整对象。evidence本次只选1至2条，每个编号必须从实际输入列表复制，不得推算或补造编号。保持摘要简洁，limitations最多3条。错误：["output_not_object","output_not_object","finish_reason"]","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
